---
import Navigation from '../components/navigation.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/base-layout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle="About">

    <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="bg-moonstone p-8 max-h-42 shadow-md justify-center align-baseline flex gap-4 w-full border-b-2">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold m-auto ml-0">About Me</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 gap-8 flex-col max-w-3xl h-full">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Who am I?</h1>
            <p>My name is Casey Groff.  Im currently studying Computer Science at the University of Wisconsin-Madison.</p>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">Why are you here?</h1>
            <p>Now thats a great question!  I use this site to document my progress and share my projects with the world.  You must be interested in seeing that progress!</p>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">What kind of projects do you work on?</h1>
            <p>I work on a variety of projects, but my major passions are software and game development.  You'll often see updates about what I've been learning or working on in here!</p>

        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
